      {
        "id": 263906,
        "name": "der andere Jan",
        "username": "der_andere_Jan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/der_andere_jan/{size}/1881_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:12:01.090Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Out of curiosity, what is your take on gravity manipulation?<br>\nMy first thought was to either put it close to magnetism (which is, essentially, Metal-bending) or Telekinesis depending on how it is used.<br>\nCome to think of it, Density control and Flying are not totally off the list either.</p>\n<p>So that makes for another nice set of Powers assembled around a shared concept, and begging to be shifted around for various alternate iterations of the hero, right?</p>",
