      {
        "id": 263907,
        "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
        "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:19:35.818Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"der_andere_Jan\" data-post=\"22\" data-topic=\"28258\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/der_andere_jan/48/1881_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> der_andere_Jan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Out of curiosity, what is your take on gravity manipulation?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>For me it’s just one of many possible flavors of Cosmic.  You could take other powers (TK, Flying, etc.) to represent reliable uses of it beyond “mangle things with gravitic force” but the main reason for doing so mechanically would be to access different Red abilities and to limit your vulnerability to having your Cosmic die stepped down or removed by twists.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2025-09-30T21:19:35.818Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": 22,
        "quote_count": 1,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
